OfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433249">অনা- ইউনিক'ড প্ৰ'গ্ৰামৰ বাবে ভাষা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1082_27628_1403596"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A toggle key that, when on, shifts the alphabetic characters on the keyboard to uppercase.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="27628">CAPS LOCK</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1403596">CAPS LOCK</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1082_27628_1403597"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A toggle key that, when on, shifts the alphabetic characters on the keyboard to uppercase.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="27628">CAPS LOCK</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1403597">CAPS LOCK কী</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1082_27629_1403596"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A toggle key that, when on, shifts the alphabetic characters on the keyboard to uppercase.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="27629">CAPS LOCK key</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1403596">CAPS LOCK</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1082_27629_1403597"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A toggle key that, when on, shifts the alphabetic characters on the keyboard to uppercase.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="27629">CAPS LOCK key</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1403597">CAPS LOCK কী</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10824_139748_1852628"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The list of animation sequences for a slide. Items are listed in the order in which they are added, and include icons that indicate timing in relation to other animation events.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="139748">Custom Animation list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1852628">কাষ্ট'ম এনিমেশ্বন সূচী</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10828_245217_433418"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A monitoring option in real-time spyware protection that monitors various types and areas of software activity on your computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="245217">agent</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433418">এজেন্ট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10839_2108_432030"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A row, column, or block of buttons or icons, usually displayed across the top of the screen, that represent tasks or commands within the program. The toolbar buttons provide shortcuts to common tasks frequently accessed from the menus.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2108">toolbar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="432030">সঁজুলি দণ্ডিকা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10841_180035_433170"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A standard Windows control that is similar to a standard text box, except that it also supports individual character and paragraph properties.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="180035">rich-text box</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433170">ৰিচ-পাঠ বাকচ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10853_14662_1906354"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A formula that performs multiple calculations on one or more sets of values, and then returns either a single result or multiple results.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="14662">array formula</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1906354">শৃঙ্খলা সূত্ৰ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10864_141438_1852639"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A chart that is placed on a worksheet rather than on a separate chart sheet. Embedded charts are beneficial when you want to view or print a chart or a PivotChart report with its source data or other information in a worksheet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="141438">embedded chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1852639">এম্বেডেড চাৰ্ট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Si