r</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11744_38453_432314"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A person, inside or outside your organization, for whom you have created an entry where you can save several types of information, such as street and email addresses, telephone and fax numbers, and Web page URLs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="38453">contact</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="432314">যোগাযোগ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11748_136786_432952"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A display setting that holds up to 256 specific color entries. Any color palette attached to a picture is by definition an 8-bit palette.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="136786">8-bit color</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="432952">8-বিট ৰং</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11757_146879_433045"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The device that communicates between your software program and your printer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="146879">printer driver</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433045">প্ৰিন্টাৰ ড্ৰাইভাৰ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11758_153847_433092"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An object created with one program and embedded into a document created by another. Embedding the object, rather than simply inserting or pasting it, ensures that the object retains its original format. If you double-click the embedded object, you can edit it with the toolbars and menus from the program used to create it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="153847">embedded object</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433092">এম্বেদ কৰি থোৱা অবজেক্ট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11765_2795839_2800110"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Microsoft's antimalware solution that provides next generation protection for desktops, portable computers, and servers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2795839">Microsoft Defender Antivirus</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2800110">Microsoft Defender এণ্টিভাইৰাছ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11765_2795839_3180180"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Microsoft's antimalware solution that provides next generation protection for desktops, portable computers, and servers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2795839">Microsoft Defender Antivirus</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3180180">Defender এণ্টিভাইৰাছ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11765_3178800_2800110"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Microsoft's antimalware solution that provides next generation protection for desktops, portable computers, and servers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3178800">Defender Antivirus</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2800110">Microsoft Defender এণ্টিভাইৰাছ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11765_3178800_3180180"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Microsoft's antimalware solution that provides next generation protection for desktops, portable computers, and servers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3178800">Defender Antivirus</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3180180">Defender এণ্টিভাইৰাছ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11767_140546_1852632"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A file containing data where individual field values are separated by a character, such as a comma or a tab.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="140546">delimited text file</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1852632">সীমাবদ্ধিত পাঠ ফাইল</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11777_64765_432513"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A tool that lets you enter complex characters and symbols, such as those used in East Asian written languages, using a standard keyboard.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="64765">IME</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="432513">IME</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11777_64765_432514"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A tool that lets you enter complex characters and symbols, such as those used in East Asian written languages, using a standard keyboard.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="64765">IME</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="432514">ইনপুট পদ্ধতি সম্পাদক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11777_64766_432513"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A tool that lets you enter complex characters and symbols, such as those used in East Asian written languages, using a standard keyboard.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="64766">input method editor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="432513">IME</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11777_64766_432514"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A tool that lets you enter complex characters and symbols, such as those used in East Asian written languages, using a standard keyboard.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="64766">input method editor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="432514">ইনপুট পদ্ধতি স