lUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16496_592343_1989250"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An apartment that consists of exactly one thread.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="592343">single-threaded apartment</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1989250">STA</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16496_592344_1989248"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An apartment that consists of exactly one thread.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="592344">STA</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1989248">চিঙ্গল-থ্ৰেডেড এপাৰ্টমেণ্ট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16496_592344_1989250"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An apartment that consists of exactly one thread.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="592344">STA</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1989250">STA</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="165_127792_2530752"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In computer graphics, a line drawn in a certain direction from a starting point to an endpoint, both of whose locations are identified by the computer using x-y-coordinates on a grid. Vectors are used in the output of some graphics programs instead of groups of dots (on paper) or pixels (on screen).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="127792">vector</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2530752">ভেক্টৰ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16504_592353_1852843"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A chart that shows a three dimensional surface that connects a set of data points. As in a topographic map, colors and patterns indicate areas that are in the same range of values.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="592353">surface chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1852843">পৃষ্ঠ চাৰ্ট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16505_592354_2765446"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to a resource in a failover cluster or server cluster that is in the process of being brought online or offline.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="592354">pending</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2765446">বিচাৰাধীন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16506_592355_1852844"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A surface chart subtype that provides a view of the surface chart from above, with colors representing specific ranges of values.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="592355">contour chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1852844">ৰূপৰেখা চাৰ্ট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16507_592356_1852845"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A contour chart displayed without color.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="592356">wireframe contour chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1852845">ৱায়াৰফ্ৰেম কনটুৰ চাৰ্ট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16508_2909978_1852846"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A chart that displays data in rings, where each ring represents a data series.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2909978">donut</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1852846">ডোনাট চাৰ্ট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16508_592357_1852846"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A chart that displays data in rings, where each ring represents a data series.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="592357">doughnut chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1852846">ডোনাট চাৰ্ট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16511_592360_1852847"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A doughnut chart that displays the contribution of each value to a total while emphasizing individual values, by showing each slice of the doughnut as "pulled out," or separate, from the whole.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="592360">exploded doughnut chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1852847">এক্সপ্ল'ডেড ড'নাট চাৰ্ট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16513_592362_1852848"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A best-fit curved trendline that is used when the rate of change in the data increases or decreases quickly and then levels out.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="592362">logarithmic trendline</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1852848">লগাৰথিমিক ট্ৰেণ্ডলাইন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16514_592363_1852849"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A curved trendline that is used when data fluctuates.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="592363">polynomial trendline</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1852849">বহুপদ ট্ৰেণ্ডলাইন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16516_592365_1852850"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A curved trendline that is used with data sets that compare measurements that increase at a specific rate.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="592365">power trendline</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1852850">পাৱাৰ ট্ৰেণ্ডলাইন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16518_592368_1852851"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A curved trendline that is used when data values rise or fall at constantly increasing rates.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="592368">exponential trendline</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1852851">সুচকীয় ষ্ট্ৰীম ৰেখা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16519_592369_1852852"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A trendline that smoothes out fluctuations in data to show a pattern or trend more clearly.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="592369">moving average trendline</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1852852">চলিথকা গড়মান ট্ৰেণ্ডৰেখা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16525_592375_2698586"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A user whose account resides in an account partner organization and who can access federated applications that reside in a resource partner organization. In the context of Office 365, a federated user is one that is sourced (mastered, authenticated, created, and managed) in an organization’s on-premises Active Directory. The on-premises Active Directory has a trust relationship with the cloud that allows authenticated Active Directory users to access cloud resources (or “services,” such a SharePoint Online, Exchange Online, etc).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="592375">federated user</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2698586">প্ৰমাণীকৃত ব্যৱহাৰকৰ্তা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1654_234919_433365"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A wizard that allows third-party developers to achieve the same look in their dialog boxes as Aero.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234919">Aero Wizard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433365">এৰ' ৱিজাৰ্ড</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16543_592397_2698571"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">For BitLocker Drive Encryption, a combination of one or more of the following elements, identified by a globally unique identifier (GUID): personal identification number (PIN), recovery password, recovery key, startup key, and Trusted Platform Module (TPM).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="592397">authentication method</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2698571">বিশ্বাসযোগ্যতা প্ৰমাণৰ পদ্ধতি</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16577_592433_1425263"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To ensure that all data sources that are used by a KPI or scorecard are available.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="592433">validate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1425263">বৈধকৰণ কৰক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16584_592444_2590650"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A directory name, used in an address, that corresponds to a physical directory on the server.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="592444">virtual directory</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2590650">ভাৰ্চুৱেল ডাইৰেক্টৰী</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16607_592811_1257064"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A numeric or other designation appended to a product name to identify a particular release.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="592811">version</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1257064">সংস্কৰণ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16609_592813_1257066"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An effect applied to a graphical object that typically reduces the difference between the outline of the object and the graphical area next to it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="592813">blur</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1257066">দাগ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16609_592813_1401803"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An effect applied to a graphical object that typically reduces the difference between the outline of the object and the graphical area next to it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="592813">blur</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1401803">অস্পষ্ট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16647_594141_1989232"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Software that provides encryption for sensitive data, such as passwords, in applications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="594141">encryption provider</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1989232">এনক্ৰিপশ্বন প্ৰদানকাৰী</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16658_600620_1852853"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The round button in the lower left-hand corner of the Windows screen that allows the user to click and display the Start menu.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="600620">Start button</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1852853">আৰম্ভ বুটাম</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16665_601385_2626345"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An attack by a malicious user or malicious software on a computer or operating system to find a secret password or a symmetric encryption key by guessing passwords or keys until the correct password or key is discovered.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="601385">key search attack</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2626345">ব্ৰুট ফ’ৰ্চ আক্ৰমণ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16665_601385_2626349"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An attack by a malicious user or malicious software on a computer or operating system to find a secret password or a symmetric encryption key by guessing passwords or keys until the correct password or key is discovered.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="601385">key search attack</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2626349">চাবি অনুসন্ধান আক্ৰমণ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16665_601386_2626345"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An attack by a malicious user or malicious software on a computer or operating system to find a secret password or a symmetric encryption key by guessing passwords or keys until the correct password or key is discovered.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="601386">brute force attack</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2626345">ব্ৰুট ফ’ৰ্চ আক্ৰমণ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16665_601386_2626349"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An attack by a malicious user or malicious software on a computer or operating system to find a secret password or a symmetric encryption key by guessing passwords or keys until the correct password or key is discovered.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="601386">brute force attack</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2626349">চাবি অনুসন্ধান আক্ৰমণ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1668_147156_1258432"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A grouping of properties presented as a tabbed page of a property sheet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="147156">property page</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1258432">বিশিষ্ট পৃষ্ঠা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote