 the mouse buttons.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="81769">mouse click</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="432638">মাউচ ক্লিক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17153_639951_2599823"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A method of authentication by which the client in a client-server communication proves its identity to the server.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="639951">client authentication</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2599823">ক্লায়েণ্ট প্ৰামাণিকীকৰণ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1716_84183_432654"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A computer hardware component providing access to a network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="84183">network adapter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="432654">নেটৱৰ্ক এডেপ্টৰ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17167_639982_1257067"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To eliminate an entity by removing it from a list, database, or other item, or by uninstalling it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="639982">remove</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1257067">আঁতৰাওক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17184_640166_1401804"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To set an entity, such as a feature, configuration, or object, back to its defaults.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="640166">reset</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1401804">পুন:স্থাপন কৰক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1730_36286_1852548"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of search conditions that is used to find data. Comparison criteria can be a series of characters that you want to match, such as "Northwind Traders," or an expression, such as "&gt;300."</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="36286">comparison criteria</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1852548">তুলনা মাপদণ্ড</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17310_640432_1257069"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To locate text or a specific item on a Web page or in a document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="640432">find</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1257069">বিচাৰক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17311_640433_1976830"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The navigation button used to complete and close a wizard.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="640433">Finish</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1976830">সমাপ্ত কৰক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17312_640434_3145827"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A navigation button used to return to a page from which the user has navigated away via the web browser Back command.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="640434">Forward</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNot