o that of a traditional laser pointer, and it is broadcast to all presentation viewers and can be recorded into video (Save to Video).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767590">Laser Pointer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1257195">লেজাৰ ইংগিতকাৰী</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21265_767631_1945962"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An option that initiates an email response addressed to all of the recipients on the To or Cc lines of the original message.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767631">Reply to All</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1945962">সকলোকে প্ৰত্যুত্তৰ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21265_767631_1945964"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An option that initiates an email response addressed to all of the recipients on the To or Cc lines of the original message.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767631">Reply to All</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1945964">সকলোলৈ প্ৰত্যুত্তৰ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</