k to open Word, Excel, and PowerPoint binary format files and securely convert them to the Office 2007 file formats.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="768625">MOICE</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1257201">MOICE</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21300_1054681_1257202"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that makes Outlook auto-complete lists available through the default Exchange mailbox.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1054681">Suggested Contacts</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1257202">পৰামৰ্শমূলক যোগাযোগ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21301_769458_1257203"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A common credential store and interface that is used to save and manage user credentials, such as user names and passwords, so you can easily log on to Web sites and connect to other resources, such as computers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="769458">Credential Manager</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1257203">প্ৰত্যয়জনক মেনেজাৰ</term><te