>homegroup computer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1257253">গৃহ গোট কম্পিউটাৰ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22249_1034328_1257254"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A troubleshooter that helps find and fix problems with viewing computers or shared files in a homegroup.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1034328">HomeGroup troubleshooter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1257254">অসুবিধা আঁতৰ কৰোতা গৃহ গোট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22259_1052661_1257255"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To group together multiple windows of the same application under a single button on the taskbar’s taskband.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1052661">combine</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1257255">একলগ কৰক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22271_1034864_1257256"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows the user to digitally alter a picture to increase or decrease the sharpness of focus.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1034864">Sharpen and Soften</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1257256">তীক্ষ্ণ আৰু কোমল</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22280_1037839_1257257"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An organizer used to add, uninstall, and search for desktop gadgets.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1037839">Desktop Gadget Gallery</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1257257">ডেস্কটপ গেজেট গেলেৰী</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22282_1037851_1793903"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A program that helps make the text on your screen easier to read for long periods of time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1037851">ClearType Text Tuner</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1793903">ClearType পাঠ টিউনাৰ</term><termNote type="geographical