y a consumer from within the context of an app to buy additional features for that app.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1612739">in-app purchase</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1642346">এপ্পৰ অন্তৰ্গত ক্ৰয়-বিক্ৰয়</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3169_232421_1852755"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of shortcuts to folders that can be displayed in the Shortcuts pane.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232421">shortcut group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1852755">চৰ্টকাট গোট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31692_1612750_1642427"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Applications in Windows Store are distributed with user-based licensing model. Windows runtime and application model will only allow applications that are for user-based license as well as signed by Windows Store to be installed/run on Windows 8.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1612750">Microsoft License Terms for Consumers</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1642427">উপভোক্তাৰ বাবে Microsoftৰ অনু