ational institutions where students can discover, acquire, and consume selected content that is subject to digital rights management.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1637178">Academic Library</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1853228">একাডেমিক লাইব্ৰেৰী</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32147_1637180_1853229"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A content control that enables a user the repeat its contents as many times as the user wants to repeat it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1637180">repeating section content control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1853229">বাৰে বাৰে চলি থকা শাখাৰ কন্টেন্ট নিয়ন্ত্ৰণ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32149_1637184_1853230"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A contextual UI element that displays additional content and controls in a container.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1637184">callout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1853230">কলআউট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech