termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33276_1764505_2244092"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To reset a system using a method that restores PC settings to defaults but retains a user's files and personalization touches.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1764505">refresh your PC</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2244092">আপোনাৰ PC সতেজ কৰক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33278_1764509_2244079"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To reset a system so that all user customizations are removed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1764509">reset your PC</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2244079">আপোনাৰ PC পুনঃসজ্জিত কৰক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33281_1764780_1767021"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service run by the Windows Store team that supports the end-to-end process for registering Windows Store developers and onboarding apps into the Windows Store catalog.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1764780">dashboard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termN