ize their purchase on a website.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1764988">Checkout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1766570">চ্চেকআউট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3329_179926_433168"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The window in which the main interaction with an object takes place.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="179926">primary window</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433168">প্রাথমিক উইণ্ড'</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3329_2071086_433168"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The window in which the main interaction with an object takes place.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2071086">main window</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433168">প্রাথমিক উইণ্ড'</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33298_1765238_1766611"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The out-of-the-box encryption capabilities that are automatically included on PCs running Windows RT.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1765238">Device Encryption</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1766611">ডিভাইচ এনক্ৰিপশ্যন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="333_232846_1852768"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A comment created by using a stylus. Microsoft Office Word treats a pen comment like any other drawing object. Pen comments don't appear in the Reviewing Pane, and Word doesn't insert comment marks in the document window.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232846">pen comment</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1852768">পেন মন্তব্য</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33306_1766385_2015599"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature of Bing that enables customers to block sites containing adult (sexually explicit) content. Customers can choose from three levels of filtering: strict (hides adult text and image results); moderate (hides adult images only); and off (doesn't hide any search results).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1766385">SafeSearch</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2015599">SafeSearch</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33322_1768216_2867846"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An enterprise-level subscription offering that includes online service versions of Word, PowerPoint, Excel, Outlook, OneNote, Access, Publisher, and Lync.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1768216">Office 365 ProPlus</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2867846">Microsoft 365 Apps for enterprise</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33322_1777199_2867846"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An enterprise-level subscription offering that includes online service versions of Word, PowerPoint, Excel, Outlook, OneNote, Access, Publisher, and Lync.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1777199">Microsoft Office 365 ProPlus</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2867846">Microsoft 365 Apps for enterprise</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected