se-wide hyper-scale repository for big data analytic workloads which allows you to capture data of any size, type, and ingestion speed in one single place for operational and exploratory analytics.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2673309">Data Lake Storage</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2500813">Data Lake Store</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39964_2673850_2500812"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The enterprise-wide hyper-scale repository for big data analytic workloads which allows you to capture data of any size, type, and ingestion speed in one single place for operational and exploratory analytics.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2673850">ADLS</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2500812">Azure Data Lake Store</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39964_2673850_2500813"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The enterprise-wide hyper-scale repository for big data analytic workloads which allows you to capture data of any size, type, and ingestion speed in one single place for operational and exploratory analytics.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2673850">ADLS</term><termNote type="