terface that is included as part of specialized Windows devices and used by developers to manage device services remotely.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2327887">Windows Device Portal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2641029">Windows ডিভাইচ প'ৰ্টেল</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40030_2635486_2641005"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The web-based interface that is included as part of specialized Windows devices and used by developers to manage device services remotely.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2635486">Device Portal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2641005">ডিভাইচ প'ৰ্টেল</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40030_2635486_2641029"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The web-based interface that is included as part of specialized Windows devices and used by developers to manage device services remotely.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2635486">Device Portal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2641029">Windows ডিভাইচ প'ৰ্টেল</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4005_44392_432358"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">One or more special characters used to separate peers in a delimited structure, at any level (fields, records, and so on).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="44392">delimiter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="432358">সীমানিৰ্দ্ধাৰক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40063_2329165_2926823"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An image representing the user, visible under their profile</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329165">profile picture</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2926823">প্ৰ’ফাইল চিত্ৰ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40080_2329245_2330437"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that lets a user hide an email message from their inbox, setting it to return to the top of their inbox at a specified date and time. It lets the user clear their inbox by postponing items that aren't urgent.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329245">Schedule</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2330437">অনুসূচী</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40081_2329246_2330435"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To mark an email message or conversation such that it moves to the top of your inbox and is flagged at a specified date and time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329246">schedule</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2330435">অনুসূচী কৰক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40082_2329247_2329574"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The combination of enterprise-related hardware and software security features that, when configured together, will lock a device down so that it can only run trusted applications.​​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329247">Device Guard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329574">Device Guard</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGend