ects grammatical errors, cases of nonsensical phrasing, and cases of word confusion such as homophones, and allows users to correct them.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2386260">Grammar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2391012">ব্যাকৰণৰ বিকল্পসমূহ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42133_2386261_2391006"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Editor feature that detects potential issues with clarity and conciseness and then makes suggestions on how to use simple, clear, and concise language.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2386261">Clarity and Conciseness</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2391006">স্পষ্টতা আৰু সংক্ষিপ্ততা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42134_2386262_2391010"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Editor feature that detects potential issues with the social register of the user’s writing and then offers suggestions to correct those issues.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2386262">Formal Language</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2