k that is being read, resembling a newspaper or other news source.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2441983">News</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2445689">সংবাদ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43103_2441984_2445690"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The font style that applies a particular font to the book that is being read to minimize clutter and create a clean look.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2441984">Pure</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2445690">স্পষ্ট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43104_2441985_2445691"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The font style that applies a particular font to the book that is being read to make it look more fun and friendly.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2441985">Relaxed</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2445691">স্বচ্ছন্দ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termN