া প্ৰচেছ’ৰ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46299_2607706_2609567"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows 10 app that helps users get online easily and in more places on their Windows 10 PC. Users sign up for a data plan and connect with mobile operators in their area using a supported SIM card.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2607706">Mobile Plans</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2609567">ম’বাইল প্লেন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="463_75391_432590"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An object that is inserted into a document from a source file and that is updated when the original source file is updated.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="75391">linked object</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="432590">লিংকড অবজেক্ট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4631_158674_1256926"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The menu for a group of ready-made shapes that includes basi