ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="47245_2660323_2661274"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The SVG filter that creates a bright spot of lighting in the image, creating a stark contrast between the lit and unlit parts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2660323">Specular Light</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2661274">স্পেকুলাৰ লাইট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="47246_2660324_2661269"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The SGV filter that adds light that is reflected in many directions, which produces a more uniform lighting effect with a smooth transition from lit to unlit parts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2660324">Diffuse Lighting</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2661269">পৰিব্যাপ্ত পোহৰ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="47291_2661363_2662067"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows users to scale resolution of each connected screen independently.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2661363">per-monitor scaling</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></ter