p type="definition">The Office Lens feature that allows users to select the document boundary by tapping the camera screen.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2661688">Tap to Select</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2663352">চয়ন কৰিবলৈ টেপ কৰক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="47313_2661690_2663351"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of lines that make up the boundary of a shape.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2661690">outline</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2663351">আউটলাইন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4732_56742_432468"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In object-oriented programming, a reusable basic design structure, consisting of abstract and concrete classes, that assists in building applications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="56742">framework</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="432468">ফ্ৰেমৱৰ্ক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">N