nges made to the same document in multiple locations that can prevent the document from being saved until they are reconciled.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2753781">page conflict</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2756899">পৃষ্ঠা দ্বন্দ্ব</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48679_2753782_2756894"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A total amount of time spent at work emailing, in meetings, and on chats or calls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2753782">collaboration time</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2756894">সহযোগ কৰা সময়</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48682_2753813_2756900"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A number that identifies a row in an Excel sheet in order, starting at 1.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2753813">row index</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2756900">শাৰী নিৰ্ঘণ্ট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNo