"partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48688_2753978_2997955"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A number that can be expressed as a quotient of two integers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2753978">rational number</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2997955">পৰিমেয় সংখ্যা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48689_2753982_2756902"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An individual who has access to their team's OneNote and libraries and who share an individual notebook with their staff leader.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2753982">staff member</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2756902">ষ্টাফ মেম্বাৰ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48692_2754091_2759196"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A physical letter sent to a person requesting a number to verify that he/she resides in the same area where he/she would like to purchase a number.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754091">verification letter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2759196">প্ৰমাণীকৰণ পত্ৰ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48693_2754106_2762633"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A disabled user object that can be used to represent and assign resources within Azure, Office 365, and Skype.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754106">resource account</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2762633">ৰিছ’ৰ্চ একাউণ্ট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48694_2754396_2759193"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Kaizala chat feature that allows users to send confidential information in a one-to-one chat more securely by not allowing message content to be forwarded or copied, by blocking messages from showing up in notifications, and by automatically deleting them after they are read.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754396">Secret Chat</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2759193">গোপনীয় বাৰ্তালাপ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48695_2754398_2759195"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An individual who has been invited by their group admin to download and join Kaizala, but who hasn't.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754398">unregistered user</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2759195">পঞ্জীয়ন নকৰা ব্যৱহাৰকৰ্তা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48697_2754411_2759191"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Diagnostic Data Viewer setting that allows users to view Office diagnostic data from a different machine.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754411">Remote Office diagnostic data viewing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2759191">দূৰৱৰ্তী Office নিদান ডাটা দৰ্শন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48698_2754414_2759189"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of diagnostic data that is collected and sent to Microsoft about Office client software being used on computers running Windows that is used to keep Office secure and up-to-date, detect, diagnose and remediate problems, as well as to make product improvements.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754414">Office diagnostic data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2759189">Office নিদান ডাটা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="487_146725_433042"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The "one" side of two related tables in a one-to-many relationship. A primary table should have a primary key and each record should be unique.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="146725">primary table</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433042">প্রাথমিক তালিকা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48703_2754422_2759190"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Diagnostic Data Viewer setting that allows users to see what Office diagnostic data is being collected.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754422">Office diagnostic data viewing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2759190">Office নিদান ডাটা দৰ্শন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48704_2754423_2759188"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A string that consists of the IP address of the user's Windows machine and the port number that the DDV app is listening on.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754423">Office connection string</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2759188">Office সংযোগ কৰা ষ্ট্ৰিং</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48720_2754440_2759192"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A minimum amount of diagnostic data necessary to help keep Office secure, up-to-date, and performing as expected on the device it’s installed on.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754440">required diagnostic data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2759192">আৱশ্যকীয় নিদান ডাটা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48721_2754441_2759181"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An Office experience that provides some of its essential functionality through the use of cloud-based services. Connected experiences are Office experiences that download online content for use in Office (such as templates, images or new fonts) and/or analyze Office content (such as to provide editing suggestions or design recommendations).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754441">connected experience</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2759181">সংযোজিত অভিজ্ঞতা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48722_2754443_2759178"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A connected experience that is not included in Office 365 ProPlus.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754443">additional optional connected experience</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2759178">অতিৰিক্ত ঐচ্ছিক সংযোজিত অভিজ্ঞতা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48723_2754445_2759187"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of data that enables the delivery of cloud-based connected experiences and that helps make those experiences secure and perform as expected.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754445">necessary service data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2759187">অত্যাৱশ্যকীয় সেৱাৰ ডেটা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48724_2754447_2759182"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of necessary service data that consists of content users create using Office, such as text typed in a Word document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754447">customer content</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2759182">গ্ৰাহকৰ সমল</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48725_2754449_2759186"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of necessary service data needed by a connected experience to perform its task, such as configuration information about the app.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754449">functional data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2759186">কাৰ্যশীল ডেটা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48726_2754450_2759194"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of necessary service data needed to keep the service secure, up to date, and performing as expected and is strictly related to a connected experience.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754450">service diagnostic data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2759194">সেৱাৰ নিদান ডাটা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48727_2754452_2759185"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A service that needs to run and send data to Microsoft in order for Office to function properly.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2754452">essential service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2759185">অত্যাৱশ্যকীয় সেৱা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48739_2755816_2762630"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to technology that is designed to be used without touch.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2755816">hands-free</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2762630">হেণ্ডছ্-ফ্ৰি</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48741_2756423_2761845"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of diagnostic data user can opt out of providing and that is used to make product improvements and provides enhanced information to help detect, diagnose, and remediate issues.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2756423">optional diagnostic data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2761845">ঐচ্ছিক নিদান ডাটা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48742_2756424_2761850"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of optional diagnostic data that indicates installed products and their version, install and uninstall status, software add-ins and their settings, and installed products and version installation status and updates readiness.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2756424">software setup and inventory data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2761850">ছফ্‌টৱেৰ ছেটআপ আৰু ইনভেণ্টৰী ডাটা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48743_2756425_2761849"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The optional diagnostic data that indicates successful app function that individual features or aspects of the application have triggered, the functioning of Office accessibility features, and privacy obligations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2756425">product and service usage data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2761849">প্ৰ’ডাক্ট আৰু সেৱাৰ ব্যৱহাৰ্য ডাটা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48744_2756426_2761848"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of optional diagnostic data that indicates an unexpected application exit and the state of that application at the time, as well as poor response time or performance for different product use scenarios.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2756426">product and service performance data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2761848">প্ৰ’ডাক্ট আৰু সেৱাৰ প্ৰদৰ্শন সম্পৰ্কীয় ডাটা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48745_2756428_2761837"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of optional diagnostic data that indicates the connection state and key device settings, such as memory.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2756428">device connectivity and configuration data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2761837">ডিভাইচৰ সংযোগক্ষমতা আৰু কনফিগাৰেশ্বনৰ ডাটা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48746_2756498_2761836"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of data that is owned by an organization rather than an individual.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2756498">company data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2761836">কোম্পানীৰ ডাটা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48749_2757085_2761838"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A SharePoint administrator for a satellite or the central location.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2757085">geo administrator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2761838">জিঅ’ প্ৰশাসক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48752_2757089_2761844"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The offer for OneDrive that includes Multi-Geo Capabilities.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2757089">OneDrive Multi-Geo</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2761844">OneDrive Multi-Geo</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48753_2757091_2761843"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A search in a multi-geo environment where queries can be sent to the index in each geo location and returned into a single result set.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2757091">multi-geo search</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2761843">মাল্টি-জিঅ সন্ধান</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48754_2757092_2761840"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to a feature that can be separately configurated for its geo location or is otherwise aware of its geo location.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2757092">multi-geo aware</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2761840">মাল্টি-জিঅ সতৰ্ক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNum