ig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51491_2905721_2905740"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows app that helps users assess the current state of their device on dimensions like battery life, storage, and updates and recommends ways to improve the device's performance or compare with the performance of a new PC.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2905721">PC Health Check</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2905740">PC-ৰ স্বাস্থ্য পৰীক্ষা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51492_2898944_2898952"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To take all actions needed to get a new device or SoC (System on a Chip) ready to successfully boot Windows, with all required drivers loading and functioning properly.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2898944">bring up</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2898952">আনক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51493_2898945_2898953"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows app that can run a variety of manufacturing and hardware tools, tests, and tasks during the OEM device bring-up and manufacturing process.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2898