he state of work in which one is able to focus completely on a task without distraction.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2926606">deep work</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2927133">গভীৰ কাম</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52001_2928689_2928878"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The security feature that helps users identify a sign-in option to verify a supplemental signal in the background while they provide their credentials.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2928689">additional factor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2928878">অতিৰিক্ত কাৰক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52002_2928699_2928880"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Edge feature that helps users solve math problems and shows them the step-by-step solution.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2928699">Math Solver</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2928880">গণিত সমাধানকাৰী</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="gram