t require any coding knowledge.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3056787">no-code</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3060854">ক’ডিং জনাৰ প্ৰয়োজন নাই</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53691_3056788_3060853"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In programming, pertaining to a development method that uses a drag-and-drop approach and requires basic knowledge of coding to finish the building and deploying process.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3056788">low-code</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3060853">ক’ডিং সম্পৰ্কে কম জ্ঞান</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53692_3056798_3057386"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In gaming, a method by which games just read and write from their desired save directory, using the standard Win32 file IO APIs, and synchronization is handled automatically.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3056798">cloud save</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3057386">ক্লাউড সংৰক্ষণ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</t