ks of color to create striking compositions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3173982">colorblock</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3174820">কালাৰব্লক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56464_3173993_3174833"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A style option available in Designer that makes an image or photograph look like a flat illustration, with clean lines, bold color palettes, and absence of gradients, shadows, or textures.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3173993">flat illustration</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3174833">ফ্লেট ইলাষ্ট্ৰেশ্বন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56466_3173995_3174831"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A style option available in Designer that makes an image or photograph look like a whimsical doodle expressed through wandering lines and shapes, exuding spontaneity and intricacy.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3173995">doodle art</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3174831">ডুডল কলা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">