ed instead of a real value which in this case is text.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="121042">text placeholder</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1852596">পাঠ প্লেচহ'ল্ডাৰ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="7271_170000_433144"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To verify that your software product is a legal copy and is installed in compliance with the Microsoft Software License Terms.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="170000">activate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433144">সক্রিয় কৰক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="7273_232522_433304"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A printed version of a presentation that can include multiple slides per page and space for audience notes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232522">handout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433304">হেণ্ডআউট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</te