e chain.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="170485">layered driver</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433145">তৰপকৃত ড্ৰাইভাৰ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="7581_237287_1852779"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows creation of mathematical formulas in documents, including the insertion of mathematical symbols inside designated "math zones" which perform automatic formatting to convert fractions, etc.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="237287">Equation Builder</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1852779">সমীকৰণ নিৰ্মাতা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="7584_130154_432905"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A portion of unique computer code contained in a virus. Antivirus programs search for known virus signatures to identify infected programs and files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="130154">virus signature</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="432905">ভাইৰাছ স্বাক্ষৰ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote