 a switch).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="315160">wired</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433721">তাঁৰযুক্ত</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9660_308305_433659"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A stored version of a document or web page.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="308305">cached page</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433659">কেশ্বড পৃষ্ঠা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9674_149113_1256990"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A list of the captions for pictures, charts, graphs, slides, or other illustrations in a document, along with the numbers of the pages the captions appear on.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="149113">table of figures</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1256990">ফিগাৰৰ তালিকা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9679_334563_1258473"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To close software, such as a program or application.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="334563">exit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1258473">প্ৰস্থান কৰক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9685_117466_1256991"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To perform the basic mathematical operation of deducting something from something else.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="117466">subtract</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1256991">বিয়োগ কৰক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9692_262665_433479"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A title animation in Windows Movie Maker.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="262665">Typewriter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433479">টাইপৰাইটাৰ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9698_230796_2587831"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An event that compromises the security of a computer, application, network or other resource.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="230796">security breach</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2587831">উলংঘন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9698_230796_2587832"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An event that compromises the security of a computer, application, network or other resource.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="230796">security breach</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2587832">নিৰাপত্তা উলংঘন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9698_2341009_2587831"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An event that compromises the security of a computer, application, network or other resource.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2341009">breach</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2587831">উলংঘন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9698_2341009_2587832"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An event that compromises the security of a computer, application, network or other resource.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2341009">breach</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2587832">নিৰাপত্তা উলংঘন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9699_150362_433078"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The measurement of the area in front of and behind the subject that is in focus.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="150362">depth of field</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433078">ফিল্ডৰ গভীৰতা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9707_237833_1425238"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collection of masters associated with a particular Visio drawing type, or template. By default, stencils that open with a template are docked on the left side of the drawing window.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="237833">stencil</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1425238">ষ্টেনচিল</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9709_144267_1852659"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A fundamental data type that holds large integers. A Long variable is stored as a 32-bit number ranging in value from -2,147,483,648 to 2,147,483,647.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="144267">Long data type</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1852659">দীঘল ডাটা প্ৰকাৰ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9718_17587_1996459"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature in Internet Explorer that remembers the information you have typed into the Address bar, web forms, or password fields, and which automatically fills in that information if you start to type the same thing again later.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="17587">AutoComplete</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1996459">স্বয়ংসম্পূৰ্ণ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9726_210054_2696050"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of reports or other data that is arranged in a panel format on a single page, or series of pages, in a web browser or SharePoint site.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="210054">dashboard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2696050">ডেশ্বব’ৰ্ড</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9733_1981778_2623523"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A pre-released version of a product that is sent to customers and partners for evaluation and feedback.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1981778">technical preview</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2623523">কাৰিকৰী পূৰ্বলোকন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9733_694772_2623523"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A pre-released version of a product that is sent to customers and partners for evaluation and feedback.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="694772">beta product</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2623523">কাৰিকৰী পূৰ্বলোকন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9734_42848_432347"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The manipulation of data to transform it into some desired result.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="42848">data processing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="432347">ডাটা প্ৰচেছিং</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9753_141881_1853357"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Text or graphics inserted in a document when Microsoft Word carries out a field's instructions. When you print the document or hide field codes, the field results replace the field codes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="141881">field results</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1853357">ফিল্ড ফলাফল</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9767_319131_433812"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to text that is aligned along the left margin.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="319131">left-aligned</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433812">বাওঁ সংৰেখিত</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9775_142952_1852645"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A drop-down list box control on a data access page that retrieves records from an underlying recordset based on the value you select from the list. On a grouped page, the control retrieves a specific group of records.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="142952">group filter control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1852645">দলীয় ফিল্টাৰ নিয়ন্ত্ৰণ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9789_158215_433116"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The company placing, and often paying for, a promotional message, or advertisement.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="158215">advertiser</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433116">বিজ্ঞাপনদাতা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9800_30472_432252"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In text-based computer graphics, a block of memory addresses that correspond to character spaces on a display screen. The memory allocated to each character space is used to hold the description of the character to be displayed in that space.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="30472">character map</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="432252">বৰ্ণ মেপ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9805_262641_433477"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A title animation in Windows Movie Maker.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="262641">Subtitle</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433477">উপ-শীৰ্ষক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9820_2727454_433612"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A directory or folder made available to users over the network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2727454">file share</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433612">ভাগ-বতৰা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9820_298002_433612"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A directory or folder made available to users over the network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="298002">share</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433612">ভাগ-বতৰা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9831_235026_433367"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of confirming that data passing into the system is correct and complies with predefined rules, definitions, or parameters.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="235026">validation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433367">বৈধকৰণ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9837_23010_432192"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The partition that contains the Windows operating system and its support files. The boot partition can be, but does not have to be, the same as the system partition.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="23010">boot partition</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="432192">বুট বিভাজন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9839_503120_2371312"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A standardized service agreement between a user and a mobile operator that establishes data service details such as pricing, types of services, and bandwidth.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="503120">data plan</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2371312">ডাটা প্লেন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9843_54256_2910581"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The use of computer files on networks, wherein files are stored on a central computer or a server and are requested, reviewed, and modified by more than one individual. When a file is used with different programs or different computers, file sharing can require conversion to a mutually acceptable format. When a single file is shared by many people, access can be regulated through such means as password protection, security clearances, or file locking to prohibit changes to a file by more than one person at a time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="54256">file sharing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2910581">ফাইল ভাগ-বতৰাকৰণ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9849_20127_432171"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In the printing and display of characters on the screen, an imaginary horizontal line with which the base of each character, excluding descenders, is aligned.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="20127">base line</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="432171">আধাৰৰেখা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9849_20128_432171"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In the printing and display of characters on the screen, an imaginary horizontal line with which the base of each character, excluding descenders, is aligned.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="20128">baseline</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="432171">আধাৰৰেখা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9865_145487_1256992"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A component database architecture that provides efficient network and Internet access to many types of data sources, including relational data, mail files, flat files, and spreadsheets. OLE DB comprises a specialized set of COM interfaces that expose data from a variety of data stores, both relational and nonrelational.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="145487">OLE DB</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1256992">OLE DB</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9865_2072504_1256992"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A component database architecture that provides efficient network and Internet access to many types of data sources, including relational data, mail files, flat files, and spreadsheets. OLE DB comprises a specialized set of COM interfaces that expose data from a variety of data stores, both relational and nonrelational.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2072504">Object Linking and Embedding Database</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1256992">OLE DB</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9865_2440377_1256992"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A component database architecture that provides efficient network and Internet access to many types of data sources, including relational data, mail files, flat files, and spreadsheets. OLE DB comprises a specialized set of COM interfaces that expose data from a variety of data stores, both relational and nonrelational.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2440377">OLEDB</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1256992">OLE DB</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9880_142307_1852643"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A substitution that occurs when Windows or your printer uses a font similar to the one you used in your publication to display or print your publication.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="142307">font substitution</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1852643">ফ'ণ্ট প্ৰতিষ্ঠাপন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9884_84006_432653"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of devices that communicate either wirelessly or via a physical connection.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="84006">network</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="432653">নেটৱৰ্ক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9889_262434_433449"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An audio effect setting that allows users with stereo headphones to experience stereo and multi-channel content without the need to set up an extensive multi-channel speaker system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="262434">Headphone Virtualization mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433449">হেডফোন ভাৰ্ছুৱেলাইজেছন মোড</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9889_262434_433450"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An audio effect setting that allows users with stereo headphones to experience stereo and multi-channel content without the need to set up an extensive multi-channel speaker system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="262434">Headphone Virtualization mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433450">ভাৰছুৱেলাইজেছন মোড</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9889_262435_433449"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An audio effect setting that allows users with stereo headphones to experience stereo and multi-channel content without the need to set up an extensive multi-channel speaker system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="262435">Virtualization Mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433449">হেডফোন ভাৰ্ছুৱেলাইজেছন মোড</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9889_262435_433450"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An audio effect setting that allows users with stereo headphones to experience stereo and multi-channel content without the need to set up an extensive multi-channel speaker system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="262435">Virtualization Mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433450">ভাৰছুৱেলাইজেছন মোড</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="989_210451_1256881"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A command that will use a print driver installed by OneNote to create an image of a wide variety of filetypes. Files are printed to the print driver and inserted as images into OneNote.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="210451">File as Printout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1256881">ফাইল মুদ্ৰণৰ হিচাপে</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9891_269336_433545"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An event triggered by Windows system components that is recorded in the system log, such as the failure of a driver or other system component to load during startup.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="269336">system event</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433545">ছিষ্টেম ইভেন্ট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="990_26447_1804329"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A system of programs and workstations used in designing engineering, architectural, and scientific models ranging from simple tools to buildings, aircraft, integrated circuits, and molecules.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="26447">CAD</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1804329">CAD</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="990_26448_1804329"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A system of programs and workstations used in designing engineering, architectural, and scientific models ranging from simple tools to buildings, aircraft, integrated circuits, and molecules.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="26448">computer-aided design</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1804329">CAD</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9900_185600_1373029"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The status that users can select to indicate that they are currently busy.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="185600">Busy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1373029">ব্যস্ত</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9911_33170_432270"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The » character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="33170">closing chevron</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="432270">চেভৰণ বন্ধ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9913_234815_433354"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An item on the Control Panel.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234815">Solutions to Problems</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="433354">সমস্যাৰ সমাধান</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="993_72941_432560"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The key arrangement used for a particular keyboard, including such factors as the number of keys (101 is the current standard) and the configuration of the keys (QWERTY is the United States standard). Some proprietary systems use different layouts, and many allow you to map the keys to characters according to your preferences.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="72941">keyboard layout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="432560">কীবোৰ্ড লেআউট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9930_34655_432281"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A profile that contains the data needed for translating the values of a color gamut. This data includes information about color, hue, saturation, and brightness.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="34655">color profile</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="432281">ৰং-প্ৰ'ফাইল</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9934_149313_1945971"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An animation effect that specifies how the display changes as a user moves from one item (such as a slide or Web page) to another.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="149313">transition</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1945971">পৰিৱৰ্তন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9934_149313_2278107"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An animation effect that specifies how the display changes as a user moves from one item (such as a slide or Web page) to another.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="149313">transition</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2278107">পৰিৱৰ্তন প্ৰভাৱ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9934_777481_1945971"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An animation effect that specifies how the display changes as a user moves from one item (such as a slide or Web page) to another.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="777481">transition effect</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1945971">পৰিৱৰ্তন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9934_777481_2278107"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An animation effect that specifies how the display changes as a user moves from one item (such as a slide or Web page) to another.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="777481">transition effect</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="as-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2278107">পৰিৱৰ্তন প্ৰভাৱ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9941_233423_432585"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of members in a dimension hierarchy such that all members of the set are at the same distance from the root of the hierarchy. For example, a time hierarchy may contain the levels Year, Month, and Day.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="233423">dimension level</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet>